{"year":"2021","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 26th Critics Choice Awards were held on March 7, 2021, hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 17637, 'screen_type': person}\">Taye Diggs</a> for the third year in a row and broadcast by The CW. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 614560, 'screen_type': movie}\">Mank</a> led the film nominations, with 12, but the big winner was <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 581734, 'screen_type': movie}\">Nomadland</a>, with four awards, including Best Picture and Best Director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1395183, 'screen_type': person}\">Chloé Zhao</a>. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 172069, 'screen_type': person}\">Chadwick Boseman</a>, who died in 2020, posthumously received the Best Actor award for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 615667, 'screen_type': movie}\">Ma Rainey's Black Bottom</a>.<br/><br/>*<i>Television awards are not included</i>."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":581734,"name":"Nomadland","image_path":"/pLwarSuyUjw6vF0U6JhlHzAa1Gp.jpg","director":"Chloé Zhao","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":581859,"name":"Da 5 Bloods","image_path":"/sl2qDR4aRHW5bAJdfiFC4H2NKWZ.jpg","director":"Spike Lee","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":615667,"name":"Ma Rainey's Black Bottom","image_path":"/qAHr52Tzmn2Nywsj9bPb1V18jdm.jpg","director":"George C. Wolfe","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":614560,"name":"Mank","image_path":"/gyjYToNFFIUKUvBYFchqpptZA1F.jpg","director":"David Fincher","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":615643,"name":"Minari","image_path":"/aQxf2xZjMoerIAqR8grFzPFNDaO.jpg","director":"Lee Isaac Chung","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":581032,"name":"News of the World","image_path":"/cLqg9BjcecdzYGqURSdWgBUO3rX.jpg","director":"Paul Greengrass","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":661914,"name":"One Night in Miami...","image_path":"/izMwtiJk4JaMTnW7UyJIpY1rAvd.jpg","director":"